---
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-white" id="overview">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Text Description Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="eyebrow-badge">About Us</div>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-[#141414] leading-tight mb-6">
          Hero Homes Lucknow
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#333333] leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Hero Homes Lucknow is a premium plotted development designed for people who want to build their dream home in a well-planned and secure township. Developed by the trusted Hero Realty, the project offers residential plots with modern infrastructure and a peaceful environment.
          </p>
          <p>
            The township features wide internal roads, landscaped gardens, green open spaces, children's play areas, jogging tracks, and 24×7 security. Every aspect of the project is planned to provide a comfortable lifestyle while ensuring excellent connectivity to major destinations across Lucknow.
          </p>
          <p>
            Strategically located, Hero Homes Lucknow enjoys easy access to schools, hospitals, shopping centres, business hubs, and public transportation — an excellent opportunity whether you're building your home or investing in Lucknow's rapidly growing real estate market.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Action Buttons -->
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <button 
            type="button"
            data-open-modal
            data-intent="Download Brochure - Overview"
            class="bg-[#c81429] hover:bg-[#a50e20] text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-6 py-3.5 rounded transition-all active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-2"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
            </svg>
            Download Brochure
          </button>

          <button 
            type="button"
            data-open-modal
            data-intent="Schedule Free Site Visit - Overview"
            class="bg-transparent hover:bg-black/5 text-[#141414] border border-[#141414]/30 hover:border-[#141414] text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-6 py-3.5 rounded transition-all active:scale-95"
          >
            Schedule Free Site Visit
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature Highlight Cards Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        
        <div class="bg-[#F5F5F4] p-6 rounded-lg border border-[#e5e5e0] hover:border-[#c81429] transition-colors group">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#c81429]/10 text-[#c81429] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-[#c81429] group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-base text-[#141414] mb-1">Gated Township</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Secured boundary with 24×7 multi-tier security and CCTV surveillance for complete peace of mind.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F5F5F4] p-6 rounded-lg border border-[#e5e5e0] hover:border-[#c81429] transition-colors group">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#c81429]/10 text-[#c81429] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-[#c81429] group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-base text-[#141414] mb-1">Hero Group Trust</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Developed by Hero Realty with a proven commitment to quality, transparent transactions, and on-time delivery.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F5F5F4] p-6 rounded-lg border border-[#e5e5e0] hover:border-[#c81429] transition-colors group">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#c81429]/10 text-[#c81429] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-[#c81429] group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-base text-[#141414] mb-1">Green Living</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Landscaped parks, tree-lined boulevards, dedicated jogging tracks, and open green recreation zones.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F5F5F4] p-6 rounded-lg border border-[#e5e5e0] hover:border-[#c81429] transition-colors group">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#c81429]/10 text-[#c81429] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-[#c81429] group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-base text-[#141414] mb-1">High Appreciation</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Rapidly developing corridor with booming real estate demand on Kanpur Road ensuring high future appreciation.</p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
